rs.flow(ParRepr#)
  .filter{r -> r.mutate{
    c -> Block#(c++, c.get)}
    > 3}
  .sort {..}
  .any {r->r.look{..}}
```
The elements after `.sort` are still `mut Repr`s: this throws the misuse error of `checkDecisions`, with `s` and `d` the `any`. Written as
```
rs.flow(ParRepr#)
  .filter{r -> r.mutate{
    c -> Block#(c++, c.get)}
    > 3}
